{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45003","headline":"采实心竹杖寄赠李萼侍御 · 皎然","name":"采实心竹杖寄赠李萼侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹杖裁碧鲜，步林赏高直。\n实心去内矫，全节无外饰。\n行药聊自持，扶危资尔力。\n初生在榛莽，孤秀岂封殖。\n干雪不死枝，赠君期君识。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45003.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45003","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}